WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:05.980
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:12.490
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.380
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:18.660
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:24.330
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:16.240
Feels great~

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:21.900
Kamaboko looks relaxed, too!

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:23.850
It's a refreshing afternoon.

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:26.370
Everyone, time for lunch! You must be hungry, right?

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:27.430
Yay!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.740
The mushrooms are just about grilled!

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:31.290
Looks so tempting!

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.860
What about Kamaboko's food?

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:39.000
He wants fish, right?

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.180
Nero said she'd catch some.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:42.760
Wait just a little longer, okay?

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:49.840
C'mon, the mushrooms are gonna burn.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:51.160
Sorry, Kamaboko!

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:53.590
Wait until Nero comes, okay?

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:03.260
Here ya go, Kamaboko!

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:05.980
You started without me!

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:06.740
Uh oh!

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:09.590
Man, I can't believe you guys.

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:10.960
So where's Kamaboko?

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.730
Huh? He's not here anymore...

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.510
Kamaboko!

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:20.760
Don't!

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:21.970
Herc!

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.310
Herc!!

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:40.030
That was...

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:40.860
Toys!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:47.120
The truck exploded, but the driver was saved!

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.230
Saved?

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:49.950
I don't think so...

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.580
He was! Look!

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.570
Thank you very much.

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:56.930
Um... May I ask for your names?

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:00.360
With a single heart...

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.970
Across two bodies!

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:06.600
Mary and Kate!

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:10.560
Dreamy!

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:13.980
So cool!

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:16.540
Ah, well, um...

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:17.640
Herc!

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:18.970
Herc-san!

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:20.940
You okay?

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:21.690
Yes.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.230
You're not hurt?

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:25.700
You're safe now, little kitty.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:27.570
Yes!

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:31.410
Well then, good day!

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.260
With a single heart...

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:34.900
Across two bodies!

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.910
Mary and Kate!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.970
What dreamy ladies...

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:43.030
They were so cool!

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:43.860
Yeah!

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.180
Mary and Kate...?

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.770
That little kitty...

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:52.980
Yes. We'll definitely capture it.

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:12.360
That was an amazing Toys! They must be really great detectives!

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:17.530
How wonderful it would be if we were to become like them...

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:18.540
Yeah, yeah!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.300
Boobs?

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.490
Like that?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.990
May we meet again...

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.400
With a single heart...

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:56.810
Across two bodies!

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:58.420
Mary and Kate!

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:08.850
Such an exquisite orb... A beautiful moon.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:11.550
It's as beautiful as me.

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.510
But you're much more beautiful.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:17.720
Beautiful me... Beautiful You...

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:21.310
Can you even hope to match such beauty?

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:27.270
Nonetheless, Beautiful You...

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:31.820
Wait!

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:37.570
How dare you mess up the night of beautiful me and Beautiful You!

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:49.450
The full moon pales in comparison to the sparkle of your Toys.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:56.010
Unlike your Toys, I don't need to eat chocolate to replenish energy after using mine.

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:58.240
You said it.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:08.380
May I meet those ladies again...

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.130
Damn, he's gone crazy!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.440
Ladies!

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.270
From this afternoon?

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:19.470
Oh man...

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:21.070
We meet again...

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:23.110
Mary-senpai! Kate-senpai!

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:25.210
So you've come to see us?

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:34.300
You're working up this late?

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:37.170
Must be hard being great detectives...

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:40.910
You must be working on a really tough case!

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:44.060
We only have mushrooms here, but please help yourself!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.570
They're almost grilled! What do you usually eat, anyways?

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.070
Those are cool clothes!

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:53.740
Um... are those detective uniforms?

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:55.190
Well, sort of.

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:56.610
What'll we do, Kate?

00:07:56.610 --> 00:08:01.790
They think that we're detectives. Let's play along for now and look for a chance to escape.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:10.870
*pitter patter*

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.150
Cool!

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:13.200
Dreamy!

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:14.520
Really?

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.030
I can smell chocolate!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:21.480
Hmm? Ah, this?

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:24.270
A chocolate made in France. Phantom thieves―

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:27.360
I mean, detectives need energy for their work.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.220
Here you go. One for you too.

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:30.860
So cool!

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.990
Ahh, wonderful!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.150
Such a wonderful room...

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:42.220
And so is the flooring!

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:44.200
Along with the walls!

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.200
Magnificent!

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:47.840
You little...

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:48.670
Mary-san!

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:52.680
What is it?

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.910
Would you like salt or sauce?

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.380
I'll leave it to you!

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:04.940
Suffocating...

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:05.650
Mary!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:06.470
Yeah!

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:09.150
Done!

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:11.080
Here you go, ladies!

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.860
Huh? Where'd they go?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.710
Th-This is...!

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:24.040
That's just his bolster. The real one's here.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.670
What on earth...

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.430
Kate, is your Toys ready yet?

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:35.630
Just a bit more!

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:42.640
Bravo, Mary!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.490
It's them!

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:49.730
They interrupted Beautiful You and I's date!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:55.030
Your hand please, Mary!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.560
This cat is now Phantom Thief Mary's...

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:00.810
...and Phantom Thief Kate's property!

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:02.620
Now, farewell!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.360
Overdoing it much?

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:08.800
They said that the cat was now theirs...

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.000
Weirdos!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:14.170
Maybe they went home?

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.380
Huh? Where's Kamaboko?

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:31.940
Was he there?

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.340
No dice!

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:34.890
Not here either...

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:36.610
He wasn't in the kitchens, either.

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:42.120
He won't even come back for food... I wonder what's happened to Kamaboko?

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.530
Permission to go out?

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:49.840
Yes. Kamaboko's gone missing, so, um...

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:56.090
Kamaboko... the alley cat that settled itself in the attic of its own accord, right?

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:59.170
Ah, yes! That alley cat...

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:05.970
You still have afternoon classes. I cannot permit this.

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:09.060
I thought so...

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:13.420
However...

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:18.400
However, if it's to improve your pet searching skills, then I give my permission.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:21.530
Yes!

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.410
Milky Holmes, dispatch!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.790
Kamaboko Search Party, heading out!

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:41.830
You can't run away, little kitty.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:44.550
Now, give yourself up and come this way.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:50.060
So you intend to hurt us like that, huh...

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.810
Just like you did that time.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:55.940
Do you know why we saved you at that time?

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:04.860
It's because we wanted to finish you off with our own hands.

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:11.550
This shall be when the curtain rises on the revenge tragedy of Mary and I!

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.310
Looking for this cat!

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:23.220
Would you know where it is?

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.450
We're looking for this cat!

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:27.560
Your cooperation is appreciated!

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:30.180
This is, um, a flyer...

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:32.840
So you took him, right?

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:34.640
Wouldn't know-oink.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.520
Ah, people of G4!

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:41.230
It's only G3 now, though...

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:43.890
Right!

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:46.830
Um, would you know where Kamaboko is?

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:48.220
Nope...

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.420
Ah, it's Milky Holmes!

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:52.700
Well then, good day.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:57.600
I heard you lost your Toys. Work hard to get them back, okay?

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:58.250
Yes!

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:03.000
Here you go... please eat these...

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.090
Thank you very much.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:06.410
Take these with you.

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:07.500
Thank you!

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.050
Good luck!

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.050
Thank you very much!

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:18.740
If you're going to hate someone, don't hate us.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:23.230
Hate the man that shares the same face as you!

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:43.960
You guys are...!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:48.670
Arsène-sama's loyal underling, Stone River.

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:49.930
His comrade, Rat.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:54.930
Their comrade, faithful and with my too-beautiful body double, Twenty.

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:57.190
The 3-Cards are here!

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:03.310
So you were the ones who've foolishly trespassed into Arsène-sama's sacred territory, huh?

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.200
What is this grotesque man?

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.540
A lover from the past?

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.220
W-What's going on?!

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:25.370
Beautifully! Beautifully!

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:27.020
Why are you using such a thing?

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.270
This cat...

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:35.610
The grotesque man in the picture and it are like two peas in a pod.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.880
But what's with the graffiti on its face?

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.400
So he really is a lover from the past?

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:48.860
Stone River!

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:01.070
That was close! Don't try to kill us all of a sudden!

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:03.380
So "a lover from the past" pushed a button, eh?

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:06.030
I'll send you flying!

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.380
My turn first!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:12.430
Toys of Flame! *glint*

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.850
Eat this!

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:22.230
There!

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:26.550
Kamaboko's not here, huh...

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:28.230
How far could he have gone?

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.580
Kamaboko!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:31.870
Kamaboko!!

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:33.030
Thank goodness!

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:34.410
You were safe?

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:36.330
What's this?

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.300
Animal cruelty!

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:39.020
Kamaboko!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.650
Kamaboko...

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:47.860
He looks like he went through something absolutely terrifying...

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:49.280
I feel sorry for him...

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.460
Unforgivable!

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:53.590
They're...

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:54.730
Ladies!

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:56.410
Phantom Thief Empire!

00:15:56.410 --> 00:16:00.130
So you took your revenge towards your old lover out on that cat, huh?

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:00.980
He wasn't a cat!

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.600
Haven't you noticed it, fools?

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:08.400
That little kitty has the same face as that man!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:11.150
Like I said, he wasn't a cat...

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:14.810
You violated Arsène-sama's territory with such a reason?!

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:20.230
Accept our brilliantly overflowing beauty, you hideous women!

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:21.230
Silence!

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:29.090
Damn―

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:29.830
It was a dummy!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.330
Beautiful You!

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:37.550
You dummy! You covered for someone like me... you're so...!

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:40.620
You threw it yourself, didn't you?

00:16:42.470 --> 00:16:46.270
How could you understand our beautiful love?!

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:50.820
Understanding love?

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:55.700
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:02.000
We are of the same heart, shared by two bodies!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:06.170
It wasn't strange at all when we fell in love with the same person.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:14.970
Even though we promised him that there'd be no hard feelings either way in choosing one of us...

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:18.390
And yet... how could it have happened?!

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:22.430
He decided that he'd dump both of us!!

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:27.200
You two are messed up! That's why he dumped you both!

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.730
Trying thinking with common sense, for once.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.070
I don't want to hear that from you.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:35.310
Common sense doesn't apply to women who get worked up over revenge.

00:17:35.310 --> 00:17:36.530
You shut up too.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:38.360
Why does it work like that?

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.320
Generally speaking.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:45.600
Ladies!

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:49.100
Why are you and the Phantom Thief Empire...?

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:55.970
That's it! They were the ones that frightened Kamaboko, so these ladies were coming to save him, right?

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.720
All for our sake!

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.540
Ladies...

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.760
Let's show them our thanks!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.150
One, two!

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:05.850
Thank you, ladies!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:09.440
What are you saying?

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:14.230
At any rate, this means we've been given another chance for revenge, eh?

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.320
That's...!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:18.340
Her Toys is coming...

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:19.990
What kind of Toys is it, Twenty?

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:22.540
Ah, it's like I don't even want to remember it...

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:24.600
Even though I should remember it...

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:27.430
But no way, even if the world's gonna end tomorrow...

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:35.050
Accept it! Mary's full moon-shaming bedazzlement!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.970
I see it! There!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:49.890
Do as you wish with my body! But I won't give you my heart!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:54.070
Beautiful me... is in ecstasy...

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:55.460
Twenty?!

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:58.780
Bitch! What did you do to Twenty?!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:04.740
It's a Technician Toys which instantly finds the opponent's weak points. I name it...

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:09.250
Heaven's High Ecstasy! Rose Pink! Pink Diamond Dream!!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.620
What's a Heaven's Diamond?

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:14.960
The diamond also carries the meaning of "seven," doesn't it?

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:19.850
In other words, she attacked with seven techniques in an instant, right?

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:21.300
Y-Yes...

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.760
I won't go down like Twenty!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:41.150
Even though you're enemies, well done...

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:43.050
You okay?

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:46.780
Hey, what was that just now? What was her Toys?

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:49.620
You'll find out for yourself sooner or later...

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.050
More importantly, run away.

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:55.390
Huh? Why? Also, why are you hunched up like that?

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:57.040
I'm telling you to run away!!

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:03.180
Ecstasy...

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.350
You did it!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.160
Ladies!

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:10.360
You were really wonderful!

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:15.030
Looks like Kamaboko was scared and hid himself.

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:16.790
I see!

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:19.420
Show them your thanks too, Kamaboko!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.640
The hindrances have disappeared, little kitty.

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:29.160
We'll give you as much <i>love</i> as we can.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.420
Damn them!

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.920
Eat this!!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.170
Ah, a bomb!

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:52.160
Kamaboko protected the ladies!

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:54.190
He saved us...

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:56.820
What a little kitty...

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:03.980
Are you okay with this, Kate?

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:11.010
I still can't believe it. That little kitty has dispelled the darkness of revenge from our hearts.

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:13.500
He's brought us back to the light, and towards our future.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:17.460
We get along well, eh? I'm of the same mind.

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:18.880
That's because we are...

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:21.560
With a single heart...

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:23.560
Across two bodies!

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:27.260
Mary and Kate!

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:30.190
Goodbye, ladies!

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:32.220
Please come and play with us again!

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:34.680
We'll be waiting with grilled mushrooms!

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:38.530
And fish, too! Chocolate souvenirs are fine!

00:21:38.530 --> 00:21:40.900
Tell us more about your Toys!

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.190
That's...

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:21.370
Eh? Huh? By myself?

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:25.320
Must I really say this alone?

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:27.200
N-No way...

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:32.150
J-Just for a few moments; close your eyes, and cover your ears, please...

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:36.050
Ah, don't! Please don't listen so attentively!

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:40.480
Don't listen! Don't! Don't!!

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:43.160
Next Time: The Princess's Substitute.

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:44.920
The culprit is me.

00:23:44.920 --> 00:23:47.820
I-Is that true...?
